        <p><span class="bold">Sri. K. MAGAN SINGH</span>, S/o Late K. SATYANARAYANA SINGH, aged 70 Years, Occupation: Business, Resident of 12-1-325/D, Dattatreya Nagar, Asif Nagar, Hyderabad, Telangana State - 500028. (Aadhaar No. 6046 3431 7974 &amp; PAN No. ANFPM1588D).</p>

