        <p><span class="bold">Sri. THAKUR SHIRISH SINGH</span>, S/o. Sri. MAGAN SINGH, aged about 40 years, Occupation: Private Employee, Resident of H.No.12-1-325/A, Dattatreya Nagar, Asif nagar, Hyderabad. Telangana State - 500028. (Aadhaar No.3411 5509 9698 &amp; PAN No. BJQPS4407R).</p>

