        <p>Hereinafter called the <span class="bold">VENDORS 1 to 5</span> which term shall mean and include their legal heirs, executors, successors, representatives&#8217; administrators and assignees etc.,</p>

        <p class="bold underline">REPRESENTED BY THEIR AGREEMENT OF SALE-CUM-G.P.A. HOLDER: -</p>

        <p><span class="bold">M/s. ANANDA HOMES</span>, (pan No. ABFFA6591E), having its Registered Office at Flat No. A1, Vista Residency, Road No.4, Plot Nos.81 &amp; 82, Block-D, Sector-I, Alkaapoor Township, Manikonda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State-500089, Represented by its Managing Partner: Sri. P.V. Sreenivasulu, S/o. Sri. P. C. V. Ramanaiah, aged about 51 years, Occupation: Business, Resident of Neknampur Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State-500 089 (AADHAAR No.7420 0525 3319, PAN No. ACNPP9239K).</p>

        <p>(Vide A.G.P.A. Registered as Document No. 17063 of 2024, Book-I, dated: 10/12/2024, Registered at S.R.O. Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State).</p>

        <p>Hereinafter called the <span class="bold">(DEVELOPER/AGPA HOLDER)</span> which term shall mean and include their legal heirs, executors, successors, representatives&#8217; administrators and assignees etc., of the <span class="bold">ONE PART.</span></p>

        <h2>IN FAVOUR OF</h2>

        <p><span class="bold">SRI. NAGENDER BOJJAWAR S/O. SRI. VIJAYAKUMAR BOJJAWAR</span>, aged about 45 years, Occupation: Private Employee, Resident of 14-176/2, Ganesh Nagar, Beside Ration Shop, Meerpet, Saroornagar, K V Rangareddy, Telangana - 500097. (AADHAAR No. 4025 8538 0070 &amp; PAN No. AENPN6035P)</p>

        <p>Hereinafter called the <span class="bold">&#8220;VENDEE(S)/ PURCHASER(S)&#8221;</span>, which term shall mean and include all his/her heirs, executors, administrators, legal representatives, nominees and assignees etc., of the <span class="bold">OTHER PART.</span></p>

        <p>WHEREAS the father of the Vendor no.1 herein late Satyanarayana Singh having share in the land in Sy.No.127, 129, 130, 133, 134, 145, 147, 148 &amp; 149 total admeasuring Ac.21 : 19 guntas, situated at Puppalguda Village, Rajendra Nagar Mandal, presently in Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS the brother of late Satyanarayana Singh namely Dhan Singh during his life time filed a suit for partition and separate possession in respect of land in Sy.127, 129, 130, 133, 134, 145, 147, 148 &amp; 149 admeasuring Ac.21 : 19 guntas, situated at Puppalguda Village, presently in Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, vide O.S.No.473 of 2000 on the file of Hon'ble IV Additional Senior Civil Judge (FTC), Ranga Reddy District at L.B. Nagar against the Satyanarayana Singh and Ramesh Singh and after contest the said suit was dismissed in the year 2009. Aggrieved by the said Judgment Dhan Singh preferred appeal before the Hon&#8217;ble High Court of Telangana vide A.S.No.552 of 2009.</p>

        <p>During pending of the appeal Dhan Singh, Satyanarayana Singh and Ramesh Singh were died and their legal heirs have brought on record and thereafter due to the intervention of the family elders and well-wishers the matter has been settled between the parties amicably and accordingly all the parties entered into a memorandum of compromise dated 14-08-2020 and the same has been filed in A.S.No.552 of 2009 before the Hon&#8217;ble High Court of Telangana and after recording the compromise the Hon&#8217;ble High Court pleased to disposed the appeal in terms of the compromise vide orders dated 23-09-2020.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS late Satyanarayana Singh during the pending of the partition suit vide O.S.No.473 of 2000 entered into a registered deed of exchange vide doc.no.9130 of 2004 dated 29-11-2004 with Mr.B.Vijay and four others, who are the owners of the land in Sy.No.128/1, admeasuring Ac.1 : 02 guntas, situated at Puppalguda Village, Rajendra Nagar Mandal, presently in Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, purchased the said land in the Auction conducted by the Government vide proceedings no.LC2/7279/2003 dated 20-09-2003. In the said exchange deed late Satyanarayana Singh had exchanged the land by giving the land admeasuring Ac.00 : 15.5 guntas, out of his share of land admeasuring Ac.00 : 18 guntas in Sy.No.127, situated at Puppalguda Village, Rajendra Nagar Mandal, presently in Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, by taking the land admeasuring Ac.00 : 15.5 guntas, out of Ac.01:02 guntas, in Sy.No.128/1, situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District with the distinct boundaries.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS late Satyanarayana Singh also entered into another deed of exchange vide Doc.No.57 of 2006 dated 02-01-2006 with one K.Rama Krishna Reddy S/o. K.Ram Reddy by exchanging the land by giving 597 Sq.yards of land in Sy.No.127, 129 and 130 situated at Puppalguda Village, Rajendra Nagar Mandal, presently in Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District by taking the land admeasuring 600 Sq.yards, in Sy.No.128/3, situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District with the distinct boundaries.</p>

        <p>The Total extent of land is as follows.</p>

