        <p>WHEREAS in the compromise entered by the parties in A.S.No.552 of 2009, the Vendor NO.1 along with his brothers Ravi Singh, Sardar Singh and Rajkumar Singh herein got the land admeasuring Ac.11: 30 guntas out of the total extent of land admeasuring Ac.21: 19 guntas, in Sy. 127, 129, 130, 133, 134, 145, 147, 148 &amp; 149 situated at Puppalguda Village, in Gandipet Mandal Ranga Reddy District.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS in view of the compromise between the parties in the appeal suit vide A.S.No.552 of 2009 before the Hon&#8217;ble High Court and as per the Memorandum of Understanding-cum-Family Settlement deed dated 17-08-2020 entered between the parties for division of lands by dividing the survey numbers and its extent of the land by all the shareholders.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS in the said Memorandum of Understanding-cum-Family Settlement deed dated 17-08-2020, the VENDOR NO.1 along with his brothers Ravi Singh, Sardar Singh and Rajkumar Singh got the land in Sy.No.130 admeasuring Ac.00 : 29 gts, in Sy.No.145 admeasuring Ac.01 : 13 gts, in Sy.No.147 admeasuring Ac.00 : 12 gts, in Sy.No.148 admeasuring Ac.03 : 03 gts and in Sy.No.149 admeasuring Ac.06 : 13 gts, total admeasuring Ac.11: 30 gts, situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS all the as per the terms of compromise the families therein got applied for mutation of land before the Tahsildar, Gandipet Mandal, R.R. District and the Tahsildar by following due procedure issued mutation proceedings in file No: B/387/2020 Dated: 27-08-2020 to all concerned.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS, the VENDOR NO.1 along with his brothers who are the other sons of late Satyanarayana Singh become the absolute owners and peaceful possessors of the property of land in Survey No.130, 145, 147, 148 &amp; 149, total extent of land admeasuring Ac.11 : 30 Guntas, situated at Puppalguda Village, Under Manikonda Municipality, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State, by virtue of Memorandum of compromise decree passed in A.S.No.552 of 2009 before the Hon'ble High Court of Telangana, at Hyderabad and subsequently got mutated their names in the revenue records vide proceedings No: B/387/2020 Dated: 27-08-2020 by the Tahsildar, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District. The shares allotted to the respective parties mentioned as follows:</p>

