        <p>WHEREAS the VENDOR NO.1 by consenting all his family members for more advantage and comfort, with an intention to derive a better advantage approached the Developer i.e., M/s. Ananda Homes (is the AGPA Holder of the Vendor 1 to 5) herein, as the AGPA Holder is a well experienced builder, for development of a Residential Complex in the locality and the VENDORS NO. 1 to 5 entered into Registered Development Agreement-cum-GPA, vide Document No.110/2021, Dated:04/08/2021,with the AGPA Holder, in the office of the Tashildhar &amp; Joint Sub Registrar, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, pertaining to the land bearing Survey No.147/A/2, 148/A/2 &amp; 149/2, to an extent of Ac.04.05 gts., situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS the VENDORS NO.1 to 5 after entering into the development agreement-cum-GPA vide Document No.110/2021, Dated:04/08/2021 for their urgent financial requirements sold the land to an extent of Ac.0.33gts., in Survey No.147/A/2, 148/A/2, out of Ac.04.05 gts., in Survey No. 147/A/2, 148/A/2 &amp; 149/2, Situated at PUPPALGUDA Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, in favour of AGPA Holder herein through Registered Sale Deed vide Document No.447/2023, Dated:03/11/2023, registered in the office of the Tahsildar&amp; Joint Sub- Registrar, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS after executing the Registered sale deed vide doc.no. No.447/2023, Dated:03/11/2023 the VENDORS NO.1 to 5 remains with Ac. 03-12 gts only in Survey No. 149/2 situated at PUPPALGUDA Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, as such the Registered Development Agreement &#8211; cum - GPA, vide Document No.110/2021, Dated:04/08/2021 is in force only for Ac. 03 : 12 guntas in Sy.No.149/2situated at PUPPALGUDA Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, only.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS as per the Registered Development Agreement-cum-GPA, Document No.110/2021, Dated: 04/08/2021, the VENDOR NO.1 TO 5 are entitled for 35.5% of the constructed area and the AGPA Holder herein is entitled for 64.5% of the constructed area.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS the VENDOR NO.1 has obtained NALA permission vide Proceedings No.2300806776, Dated:26/10/2023 for conversion of land from agriculture to non-agriculture in respect of land bearing Survey No.149/2 admeasuring Ac. 03.12 gts., situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District from the Tahsildar, Gandipet Mandal, Rangareddy District.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS the AGPA Holder herein has also entered several Development Agreements-cum-GPAs in respect of adjacent lands belongs to other owners. The AGPA Holder being the Developer of the land has obtained HMDA approved plan for 11 Blocks with 3 basements + Ground + 22floors and 12th Block with 3 cellars + Ground + 5 upper floors, Amenities Block-1, 3 Cellars + Ground + 4 upper floors and Amenities Block-2 with 3 Cellars + Ground+3 upper floors in Survey No.128/P, 129, 130/P, 145, 147, 147/P, 148 and 149, to an extent of 73,240.67 Sq. Meters or Ac: 18.04 gts, situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Rangareddy District, by virtue of Permission No. 01722/SKP/PLG/HMDA/2022, Dated:25/06/2024,and the project was named as &#8220;THE LEGACEY&#8221; In the process of getting the above HMDA permissions, an area to the extent of 5761.65 Sq. Meters equivalent to 6890.88 Square Yards, out of the entire extent of 73240.67 Sq. Meters equivalent to 87595.11 Sq. Yards is gifted for widening of Road, which is registered in favor of The Commissioner, Manikonda Municipality vide Registered Gift Deed Document No: 16083/2023 Dated 29-12-2023 registered at S.R.O., Gandipet. Hence, M/s. Ananda Homes &amp; Others is developing the project in the extent of 67479.02 Sq. Meters Equivalent to 80704.23 Sq. Yards (after adjusting the area under road widening and considering the physical availability) referred to as the Total Property and is described in details in the Schedule A hereto. and the same is accepted by all the Land Owners in this project including the VENDORS NO.1 TO 5.</p>

        <p>AND WHEREAS, The Developer/AGPA Holder had registered the Project THE LEGACEY for 11 (eleven) Blocks, with 3 Basements, and Ground Floor, and 22 Upper Floors, 12th Block with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 5 Upper Floors, Amenities Block-I, 3 Cellars and Ground Floor, 4 Upper Floors, and Amenities Block-II, with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 3 Upper Floors, under the provisions of the Act with the Telangana Real Estate Regulatory Authority(TSRERA) at Hyderabad and has been granted registration No. P02400008615, dated:07/08/2024.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS at the time of entering into Registered Development Agreement-cum-GPA vide DocumentNo.110/2021, Dated: 04/08/2021, registered at office of the Tahsildar &amp; Joint Sub-registrar, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State, it is agreed for construction of G+14 Floors only. But due to the market conditions with the consent of the VENDOR NO.1 to 5 and other Land owners, the AGPA Holder being the builder applied and acquired the building permission from HMDA for 11 Blocks with 3 basements with Ground + 22 floors and 12th Block with 3 cellars + Ground + 5 upper floors, Amenities Block-1, 3 Cellars + Ground + 4 upper floors and Amenities Block-2 with 3 Cellars + Ground + 3 upper floors, now in the changed circumstances and increase in the floors and constructed area, the VENDOR NO.1 to 5 will be entitled for 32.75% and the Developer is entitled to 67.25% which will supersede the percentage as agreed in the Registered Development Agreement-cum-GPA bearing Document No.110/202, Dated:04/08/2021 and the same was reduced in the Registered Supplementary Agreement vide Doct.No13649/2023, dated:03-11-2023 registered at Sub-Registrar, Gandipet, Rangareddy District.</p>

        <p>WHEREAS the VENDOR NO.2 TO 5 are the sons and daughters of the VENDOR NO.1 and the VENDOR NO.1 TO 5 in consultation of each other came to a conclusion to sell developed area of 79,890 Square Feet for their convenience and necessities, as per the Registered Supplementary Agreement vide Doct. No. 13649/2023, Dated:03/11/2023 and made their proposal with the AGPA Holder herein who is the builder of the VENDOR NO.1 TO 5 and the AGPA Holder herein agreed to purchase the area of 79,890 square feet for the sale consideration mentioned above. However, the flats allocated against the developed area allocated to vendor no.1 to 5 will be allocated with only one car parking to each flat, the flats which are agreed to be sold is shown in the below mentioned table:</p>

